#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &infocenter; (from now on referred to simply as <quote>the information "
"center</quote>) provides you with a centralized and convenient overview of "
"your &kde; and system settings."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The information center is made up of multiple modules. Each module is a "
"separate application, but the information center organizes all of these "
"programs into a convenient location."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using The &infocenter;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This next section details the use of the information center itself. For "
"information on individual modules, please see <link linkend=\"module\">Info "
"Center Modules</link>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starting the &infocenter;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &infocenter; can be started 3 ways:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By selecting <menuchoice><guimenu>K Button</guimenu><guisubmenu>System</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Info Center</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the "
"&kde; Panel."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By pressing <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>F2</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This will bring up a dialog box. Type <userinput><command>kinfocenter</"
"command></userinput>, and click <guibutton>Run</guibutton> or press "
"<keycap>Enter</keycap>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can type <command>kinfocenter &amp;</command> at any command prompt."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid "All three of these methods are equivalent, and produce the same result."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &infocenter; Screen"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you start the information center, you are presented with a window, "
"which can be divided into 3 functional parts."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Across the top is a menubar. The menubar will provide you with quick access "
"to most of &infocenter;'s features. The menus are detailed in <link linkend="
"\"info-center-menus\">The &kde; Info Center Menus</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Along the left hand side, is a column. This is a where you choose which "
"module to investigate. You can learn how to navigate through the modules in "
"the section called <link linkend=\"module-intro\">Navigating Modules</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid "The main panel shows you some system information."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &infocenter; Menus"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This next section gives you a brief description of what each menu item does."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>File</guimenu> menu has a single entry."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid "Closes the info center."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Help</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: sect2
#: index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "&help.menu.documentation;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid "Exiting The &kde; Information Center"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:189
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can exit the info center one of three ways:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> from the menu bar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Type <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> on the "
"keyboard."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the <guiicon>Close</guiicon> button on the frame surrounding the "
"info center."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &infocenter; Modules"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:225
#, no-c-format
msgid "Navigating Modules"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:227
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a list of the <emphasis>standard</emphasis> configuration modules "
"(sorted by category) provided by the <application role=\"package\">&kde; "
"base</application> package. Please note that there may be many more modules "
"on your system if you have installed additional software."
